<title>NEW ZEALAND: FCNZ Forests raises US$831m through 7-yr facility.</title>
<headline>FCNZ Forests raises US$831m through 7-yr facility.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>FCNZ Forests Partership, owned by Fletcher Challenge, Brierley Investments and China International Trust and Investment Corp (CITIC), said on Friday it had raised US$831 million through a seven year term loan facility.</p>
</text>
